WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.161 --> 00:00:02.776
(lively music)

00:01:22.633 --> 00:01:25.214
- I've never had Red Vines
or Twizzlers in my life.

00:01:25.214 --> 00:01:26.923
- I never really ate Twizzlers because

00:01:26.923 --> 00:01:30.111
I was allergic to them and
didn't even know Red Vines

00:01:30.111 --> 00:01:32.181
were a thing until pretty recently.

00:01:32.181 --> 00:01:34.965
- I'm from Scotland and to
the best of my knowledge

00:01:34.965 --> 00:01:38.751
we don't have either of these.

00:01:38.751 --> 00:01:41.316
- I appreciate the texture.
It feels kind of cool.

00:01:42.367 --> 00:01:43.925
- Oh, no.

00:01:43.925 --> 00:01:45.226
- I don't like this.

00:01:45.226 --> 00:01:47.733
- It tastes kind of like medicinal.

00:01:47.733 --> 00:01:50.143
- It's like play dough meets Robitussin.

00:01:50.143 --> 00:01:52.213
- It doesn't taste like a sweet candy.

00:01:52.213 --> 00:01:54.463
I don't know why you would eat this.

00:01:54.463 --> 00:01:55.903
- This is quite yummy.

00:01:55.903 --> 00:01:57.951
- The taste of this one
is way more bearable.

00:01:57.951 --> 00:02:00.138
- This one's harder to chew though.

00:02:00.138 --> 00:02:03.082
- It tastes kind of
like a muted gummy bear.

00:02:03.082 --> 00:02:05.215
- It tastes more fresh.

00:02:05.215 --> 00:02:06.869
- I like the second one better.

00:02:06.869 --> 00:02:08.629
- I definitely prefer number two.

00:02:08.629 --> 00:02:12.964
- I guess I liked Twizzlers
more than Red Vines.

00:02:19.914 --> 00:02:21.215
- You just got to do you.

00:02:21.215 --> 00:02:23.071
If you like Red Vines,
keep eating Red Vines.

00:02:23.071 --> 00:02:25.514
If you like Twizzlers, eat Twizzlers.

00:02:25.514 --> 00:02:27.274
I'm going to be sitting
here eating neither,

00:02:27.274 --> 00:02:29.337
and that's okay too.

